{1}{Virgil!  And you...!  [The man's eyes are full of anger as he turns them on you.]  Do you have any idea what you've done?  What your evil ways might mean for all of Arcanum...?}{Virgil!  And you...!  [The man's eyes are full of anger as he turns them on you.]  Do you have any idea what you've done?  What your evil ways might mean for all of Arcanum...?}{}{1}{}{gf2652 1}
