{5}{Don't you pretend not to know what I'm talking about!  I heard what you did in Stillwater...the blood of those people is on your hands!  [He turns on Virgil.]  And you!  I trusted you to be a guide, to turn from your old ways!  And yet you're nothing but a common murderer...just as you came to me so many months ago...}{Don't you pretend not to know what I'm talking about!  I heard what you did in Stillwater...the blood of those people is on your hands!  [He turns on Virgil.]  And you!  I trusted you to be a guide, to turn from your old ways!  And yet you're nothing but a common murderer...just as you came to me so many months ago...}{}{2}{}{}
