{9}{Yes, it is I!  Did you think I would stand by and watch while you committed vile acts of betrayal and murder in the name of Nasrudin?  I will not stand for this heresy!  You both shall pay for what you have done...}{Yes, it is I!  Did you think I would stand by and watch while you committed vile acts of betrayal and murder in the name of Nasrudin?  I will not stand for this heresy!  You both shall pay for what you have done...}{}{3}{}{}
