{15}{You better shut up or I gonna kill you...}{}{-4}{}{-11}{}
{17}{Talk about it?  Do you know the value of the gift you were given?  You were the incarnation of the greatest elf in the history of Arcanum!  You were given the power to save the world!  And you squandered it, became as evil as Arronax himself!}{Talk about it?  Do you know the value of the gift you were given?  You were the incarnation of the greatest elf in the history of Arcanum!  You were given the power to save the world!  And you squandered it, became as evil as Arronax himself!}{}{4}{}{}
{18}{The prophecy doesn't say how it happens. Perhaps this is right...}{}{5}{}{26}{}
