{26}{What?  You've slaughtered an entire town of innocents!  Arronax himself might have thought twice on such a thing!  This path you've chosen is a dark one...you've turned your back on the world.  I will no longer tolerate this travesty.  Prepare yourself, heretic...!}{Right?  You've slaughtered an entire town of innocents!  Arronax himself might have thought twice on such a thing!  This path you've chosen is a dark one...you've turned your back on the world.  I will no longer tolerate this travesty.  Prepare yourself, heretic...!}{}{5}{}{}
