{30}{Uh...Virgil?}{}{-4}{}{-11}{}
{32}{[Joachim looks resigned.]  Yes, the gift was yours.  And the choice was always yours what you would do with it.  As is the choice I must make now.  You can't be allowed to continue acting in the way that you are...I'm sorry...}{[Joachim looks resigned.]  Yes, the gift was yours.  And the choice was always yours what you would do with it.  As is the choice I must make now.  You can't be allowed to continue acting in the way that you are...I'm sorry...}{}{6}{}{}
